msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Opt_Flatter"
msgstr "[Flatter] Those scars... you must have seen a hundred battles."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_FlatterGood_1"
msgstr "Heh. A hundred and six. You've got a good eye, stranger."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_FlatterBad_1"
msgstr "Save the honey for someone who can't smell it. Out with it."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Offer_1"
msgstr "There is an old battlefield somewhere in these lands. Nobody who went looking came back to tell where."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Offer_2"
