msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Working_1"
msgstr "You're still here? The battlefield won't find itself."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Opt_GiveUp"
msgstr "I'm done with this errand of yours."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_HaveIt_1"
msgstr "That look on your face... you found it, didn't you?"

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Opt_TurnIn"
msgstr "Here's your coal from the burned ground."

msgid "Dlg_Veteran_Thanks_1"
msgstr "So it's true then. Take this — and forget you ever told me."


